WEBVTT - Visual Editor Enhancements: overview film (en)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:06.284
Editing an element means managing its entries,
too.

2
00:00:07.384 --> 00:00:11.890
Visual Editor Enhancements keeps both close to
the page.

3
00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:20.624
Choose Entries beside settings. A compact panel
lists the questions, cards or list items.

4
00:00:21.674 --> 00:00:29.341
Rename an entry right in the list. For text and
media, Edit in form opens the TYPO3 form.

5
00:00:30.391 --> 00:00:36.987
Add an entry below the list. New entries start
hidden. Adding and removing save immediately.

6
00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:44.215
Field settings stay in their own panel. These
changes wait for the next Save.

7
00:00:45.265 --> 00:00:51.129
Find new elements in the library, with live
previews and search that forgives typos.

8
00:00:52.179 --> 00:00:56.554
The rich-text toolbar sits in one row above the
text.

9
00:00:57.604 --> 00:01:02.084
Hover a button, and a chain icon opens the link
browser.

10
00:01:03.384 --> 00:01:09.300
Enable collection editing in your user settings.
Then open a page and try Entries.
